	(text "Anti-alias + Riso + charge bucket. fc = 241kHz.\nR6 <= 200 ohm per ADS7883 SLAS594 p.11.\nC0G REQUIRED: X7R drifts with temp and DC bias,\nwhich would move the corner frequency.\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 153.924 66.294 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "1a7dacd1-17f1-4c23-9989-f56a3f2ae123")
	)
	(text "Compensation: adjust C5 so R4*C5 = R5*C6.\nTune with 1kHz square wave: flat top = correct,\nsagging = undercomp, overshoot = overcomp."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 75.184 69.596 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "4a0e5f54-bd45-49db-9891-5d01cbf4909f")
	)
	(text "Buffer: divider output impedance = 750k||250k = 188k.\nADS7883 needs source impedance < 200 ohm (SLAS594 p.11,\n\"Driving the VIN and VDD Pins\"). Buffer makes it a few ohms.\nMCP6292 rail-to-rail I/O, GBW 10MHz (DS20001812).\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 125.476 90.678 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "4d6c3f54-400f-4bbf-a6b1-1f0ca57b7180")
	)
	(text "Protection: R4 (750k) limits fault current.\n100V fault -> 133uA. BAV99 rated well above this.\nD1 limits voltage to rail +/- one diode drop.\nADS7883 abs max on VIN: -0.3V to VDD+0.3V (SLAS594 p.2)\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 100.838 72.898 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "69be7f38-f022-4164-873c-30896457a9b2")
	)
	(text "Single-ended, NOT isolated. Shell = system GND = USB GND = mains earth.\nMax +/-5V direct, +/-50V with 10x probe. NEVER connect to mains."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 53.848 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "afd41fee-7f3b-4087-805c-fc8595cf257a")
	)
	(text "R4/R5 values are NOMINAL. Measure the actual pair on the DMM\nand store the measured ratio as a calibration constant in\nfirmware (oscil_cal.h). Ratio sets gain; sum sets input Z.\nAbsolute value does not matter, matching does."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 66.294 82.042 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "b3631885-c15d-4c3e-803b-b283a82af063")
	)
	(text "space reserved for ADC driver stage if settling is\nmarginal at 2MSa/s"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 183.642 43.434 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.635 0.635)
			)
		)
		(uuid "f4d30153-b293-4933-81e1-e6812cb78ab1")
	)
